---

Norms exported by the Atlas and the browser edition carry a Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0) in their metadata sidecar,
which is stated separately because the data and the code are licensed apart.

Word-bank sources retain their own terms. Zipf frequencies derive from wordfreq
(Speer, 2022, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7199437), which is redistributable
with attribution. English concreteness values derive from Brysbaert, Warriner
and Kuperman (2014, https://doi.org/10.3758/s13428-013-0403-5), offered freely
for research and redistributed here with attribution rather than relicensed.
